  "html": "<h1 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 22px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>合作案例</strong></span></h1><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>一、喜马拉雅车机版</strong></span></h2><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1.1 分发优势</strong></span></h3><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/7398a4f463a6420590f7b70438f12147.png?auth_key=1795677198-a72ce5e4298d4858aa750fb2bc7b946a-0-81e91914a0f1f0673d19ddf8caff133ea49434ac9fcb0e7dd770d2d7c62c0503\" alt=\"1.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 1316.12px;height: 259.92px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-1 分发优势</span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1.2 智能语音联动</strong></span></h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>车机智能语音控制：</strong></span></p><ul><li style=\"line-height: 1.75;\">打开喜马拉雅</li><li style=\"line-height: 1.75;\">播放有声书</li></ul><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/b363b5ff35c24ba585e5f6c4839d2c9e.png?auth_key=1795677198-ce38e94247c94716839a04e23f92d0e4-0-9c5e93e8c960124e16ff1a5a71228b7c109084cff5d731866bcd49077823b06c\" alt=\"2.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-2 智能语音联动</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">*功能实现与车机系统相关，以实际为准。</span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1.3 场景自动化</strong></span></h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>适用场景：长时间驾驶的场景</strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>长途驾驶：开始长途驾驶</strong></span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">导航规划路线</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">调整座椅到设置位置</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">播放喜马拉雅有声书</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">关闭车窗</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/48051f257c014717a2c9935f5109a31d.png?auth_key=1795677198-25ad844ce56a4ef3b4f7c531242d161d-0-a2db785dde52531ba0a871a534a4a1c0b7a09238077f679a07ac99f8cf15aeed\" alt=\"3.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-3 场景自动化</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">*功能实现与车机系统相关，以实际为准。</span></p>"
